From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ilya Vysotsky <il.mohoff2016@yandex.ru>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 07:00:34 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] Widget: the headless widget is the shell's view

The engine draws for a XAML page it does not own: the headless widget
takes the shell's size, input, screen and panel, and hands frames and
notifications back through a small C interface.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
